OL,3,GNEWSASeven arrested over suspected     
OL,4,Aillegal meat supply                    
OL,6,FSeveral men have been arrested after 23
OL,7,Fanimals were found dead on a farm and  
OL,8,Fhundreds of others showed signs of     
OL,9,Fsuffering.                             
OL,11,FDevon and Cornwall Police said officers
OL,12,Fforced entry onto a farm in Highampton,
OL,13,FWest Devon, on 13 November, where it   
OL,14,Ffound a suspected illegal meat supply  
OL,15,Foperation along with suspected         
OL,16,Flivestock thefts.                      
OL,18,FIn addition to the dead and suffering  
OL,19,Fanimals, officers found 41 others      
OL,20,Fbelieved to be being prepared for      
OL,21,Fslaughter.                             
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
