OL,3,GNEWSASeven arrested over suspected     
OL,4,Aillegal meat supply                    
OL,6,FPolice said seven men had been arrested
OL,7,Fin connection with the operation. All  
OL,8,Fhave been bailed and investigations    
OL,9,Fcontinue.                              
